        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 1:50AM EDT until September 26 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Miami FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 10 to 15 kt with gusts up to 20 kt and seas
5 to 8 ft expected.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Deerfield Beach to Ocean Reef FL
out 20 NM and Waters from Deerfield Beach to Ocean Reef FL
from 20 to 60 NM excluding the territorial waters of Bahamas.

* WHEN...From 1 PM Friday to 8 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
